Package: marshfield
Title: Plan and Process Vegetation Sampling for UMass UAS Project
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person('Bradley', 'Compton', email = 'bcompton@umass.edu', role = c('aut', 'cre'), 
       comment = c(ORCID = '0009-0002-2375-8116'))
Description: A grab-bag package for planning a vegetation sampling field season for
    the UMass UAS project (specifically, UMass UAS 2026), including formatting tide
    tables, preparing a site shapefile, preparing maps for Avenza, summarizing field
    samples on the fly, and processing collected data.
